OL,3,GNEWSAMore teenagers getting flu
OL,4,Avaccination is 'vital'
OL,5,
OL,6,FMore than 96,000 children aged four to
OL,7,F16 across Devon, Cornwall and the Isles
OL,8,Fof Scilly did not get flu vaccines last
OL,9,Fwinter, with more older children
OL,10,Fmissing out, according to government
OL,11,Ffigures.
OL,13,FJust over half of children aged four to
OL,14,F16 in Cornwall and the Isles of Scilly
OL,15,Fhad a flu vaccine last winter, with
OL,16,F53.1% of children vaccinated in Torbay,
OL,17,F56% in Plymouth and 60.4% in Devon, the
OL,18,FUK Health Security Agency (UKHSA) said.
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
