OL,3,GNEWSAMore teenagers getting flu
OL,4,Avaccination is 'vital'
OL,5,
OL,6,FDr Fiona Neely, UKHSA consultant in
OL,7,Fhealth protection, said children of
OL,8,Fprimary and secondary school age were
OL,9,F"among the biggest spreaders of the
OL,10,Fvirus" and it was "concerning" fewer
OL,11,Folder pupils were vaccinated.
OL,13,FShe added: "It's vital we turn this
OL,14,Faround."
